{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104165439746-1104_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261104170140\"/><p>韓正將應邀赴土耳其出席聯合國氣候大會。</p><p>中國外交部發言人周三（4日）宣布，國家副主席韓正將應邀於周五（6日）至下周四（12日）赴土耳其，出席聯合國氣候變化框架公約第31次締約方大會（COP31）安塔利亞領導人峰會，並訪問格魯吉亞。</p><p>聯合國氣候變化框架公約第31次締約方大會將於下周一（9日）至本月20日，在土耳其安塔利亞舉行。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:25:40.880277+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:54:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:58.551192+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:46.828855+00:00","content_hash":"040f8c46c4dd388b66bbe00c13ee22b9625ab275d1e55f28ecab8bab2cd19e14","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}